editor_description = "Cole, a lay brother (Look and Feel, 'Characters': a big labourer; weathered, blank; a brown work tunic, not a habit). He keeps the gate by day. A rope for a belt, hose, heavy boots (tools/build/chr_cole.py). Model is his body on its skeleton, with his clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is his face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
